>**{c=red:You must zone after completing }{q:Yomi Okuri|Yomi Okuri|Yomi Okuri}{c=red: to begin this quest!}**
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Jaucribaix} in {z:Norg} (K-8) to begin the quest.
* Speak to {n:Sanosuke} in {z:Port Jeuno} (H-8). (Inside the Duty Free Shop.)
* Speak to {n:Phoochuchu} in {z:Mhaura} (H-8) (ground level; under the bridge).
* Examine the door on the lower level in {z:Bastok Mines} (J-6). (Close to the Alchemy Guild.)
** The door must be closed at the time it is examined. Examining the door while already opened by another player will result in the cutscene not triggering.
* Enter the {z:Waughroon Shrine} through the {z:Palborough Mines} top floor.
** You may use {n:Domenic} to get the cutscene.
*** Homepoint warp is the fastest way if you have it unlocked.
* Speak to {n:Jaucribaix} in {z:Norg} to receive a {i:Banishing Charm|Banishing Charm|1166}.
* Trade the Banishing Charm to the Burning Circle in Waughroon Shrine to begin a BC fight.
** Inside the BC there will be three {p:Demons|Category:Demons}: {m:Rasetsu} (DRK), {m:Gaki} (BLM), and {m:Onki} (SMN).
** Onki will have an elemental summon, and all three demons are able to use their respective two-hour abilities.
** There is a 30 minute time limit.
** {p:Trust Magic} can be used in the BCNM.
* After defeating the demons, you will receive the {p:key item|Category:Key Items} {k:Charred helm}.
* Speak to {n:Jaucribaix}, he will request a {i:Gold Thread|Gold Thread|823}.
* Trade a Gold Thread to {n:Jaucribaix}.
* Zone out of {z:Norg}, then return to {n:Jaucribaix} for your reward.
** You can toss the {i:Banishing Charm|Banishing Charm|1166} after completing the quest, as it serves no further purpose.

